OL,5,G1000 The Highland Vet
OL,6,     FObservational documentary series
OL,7,     Ffollowing vets in Thurso and Wick.
OL,8,     FSenior vet Ken must enlist the
OL,9,     Fhelp of young vet David as they
OL,10,     Fdeal with a miss-firing Suffolk
OL,11,     Ftup.
OL,12,G1100 Ben Fogle: New Lives in the Wild
OL,13,     FBen meets 50-year-old free spirit
OL,14,     FNara, who has spent most of his
OL,15,     Fadult life without mod cons, and
OL,16,     Flearns how Nara's unconventional
OL,17,     Fchildhood shaped his outlook.
