OL,8,     Fforests of Canton, Maine, where he
OL,9,     Fmeets Arthur, a hunter-gatherer
OL,10,     Fwith a PhD in botany.
OL,11,G1300 Murder She Wrote
OL,12,     FJessica unearths a suspicious
OL,13,     Fdeath in the desert during an
OL,14,     Fexcavation of a Native American
OL,15,     Fsite where gold is discovered.
OL,16,G1400 Murder She Wrote
